	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]Adds a new constructible building - Kenneth's Vegetable Shop (built by Robin) - with 172 custom vegetables to buy![/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Customization: By default, all vegetable items appear in the shop. If you prefer a smaller selection and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual vegetables to remove them from the shop. Re-enabling a vegetable restores it to the shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]More details can be found in ReadMe.txt.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Please do not reupload this mod or include it in modpacks without permission.[/b][/size]",
